msgid "{count} file copied on {name} came along with the pointer. It waits in the temporary folder until you paste it."
msgid_plural "{count} files copied on {name} came along with the pointer. They wait in the temporary folder until you paste them."
msgstr[0] "{count} файл, скопированный на {name}, пришёл вместе с указателем. Он ждёт во временной папке, пока вы его не вставите."
